## §5 Rows NOT applied
a1  (P1) 003 "کچھ فیصلوں میں غفلت سے چوٹ پر تقریباً 3 ماہ قید ہوئی ہے؛ یہ نہ عام سزا ہے نہ یقینی نتیجہ" (and the 4/6-month line).
    SKIPPED. The current wording is not a translation error — it is exactly what RULEBOOK-FIX R3 prescribes:
    «003 "courts currently impose about 3 months" / "4 months" / "6 months" → "in some judgments about 3 months has been
    imposed; there is no typical or guaranteed outcome" (keep the digits)». ACCEPTED-ROUND additionally forbids making a
    result sentence positive again ("Requests to make a … result sentence positive → never"). This is why it is still
    "unfixed since round 4": it is deliberately not to be fixed. See §6.
